WEBVTT

00:02:59.467 --> 00:03:02.637
that it motivated them
to show up every single day,

00:03:02.678 --> 00:03:03.846
for two years,

00:03:03.846 --> 00:03:06.015
to learn how to color
themselves in the comic

00:03:06.057 --> 00:03:08.267
and animate themselves in the video game.

00:03:09.018 --> 00:03:11.896
Now, the Love Punks
began as a collaboration

00:03:11.896 --> 00:03:16.484
with a community of around
40 people and five grandmas.

00:03:17.193 --> 00:03:18.194
There was --

00:03:18.277 --> 00:03:20.112
Grandmas, they were the wildest punks.

00:03:20.154 --> 00:03:21.155
(Laughter)

00:03:21.197 --> 00:03:22.657
And in Australia,

00:03:22.657 --> 00:03:25.868
they went on to inspire
a live-action TV series

00:03:25.868 --> 00:03:28.162
and a national curriculum

00:03:28.204 --> 00:03:31.082
teaching young Australians
how to become Love Punks.